  The system ignores the colours here and uses only the shape, tinting it to
  match the launcher's wallpaper theme. So this is the same artwork drawn as
  one solid silhouette: the two-tone leaves and the two ledger pages would be
  indistinguishable once flattened, and the ledger's shading is dropped rather
  than left as an invisible seam.
-->
